<div class="grid grid-cols-11 gap-x-4 md:grid-cols-24 max-w-sm md:max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full">
  <%= render "layouts/header" %>
  <% if cookies[:first_class_free_banner_dismissed].blank? %>
  <div id="first-class-banner" class="col-span-full flex items-center justify-center relative py-3 px-4 mt-0.5 mb-4 rounded border border-brand-gold bg-[rgba(244,167,0,0.25)]">
    <span class="font-medium text-base text-center text-banner-text">The next class is <%= next_class_day %>. Contact us at <%= render "layouts/email" %> to start your free 2 weeks of classes!</span>
    <button type="button" class="first-class-banner-close absolute top-0 right-0 p-1 text-xl leading-none cursor-pointer border border-brand-gold rounded-tr rounded-br bg-[rgba(244,167,0,0.4)] hover:bg-[rgba(244,167,0,0.6)] text-gray-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-gold focus:ring-offset-2" aria-label="Dismiss banner">&times;</button>
  </div>
  <% end %>
  <%= render "layouts/left_sidebar" %>
  <div class="col-span-11 bg-content-bg p-4">
    <h1>About Our Classes</h1>
    <p>
      Classes are held every <b>Wednesday at 8:30 pm</b> and <b>Saturday at 2 pm</b> at <b>549 Zor Shrine Place</b>. Your first two weeks of training are totally free. If you decide you would like to join the Okinawan Karate Club of Madison, dues are a flat <b>$75 a month</b> with no long term contracts and no hidden fees.
    </p>
    <h3>Who may join:</h3>
    <p>
      Membership is open to <b>adults</b> and <b>teens 13 and over</b> (with parent or guardian permission). For your protection we require all members to have health insurance or equivalent health coverage. We strongly encourage you to seek the advice of your physician before beginning any new exercise regimine.
    </p>
    <h3>New to martial arts?</h3>
    <p>
      If this is your first martial arts class, welcome. Please bring
      <ul>
        <li>loose-fitting, comfortable workout clothes</li>
        <li>water</li>
        <li>a positive attitude</li>
      </ul>
      We train in bare feet. If you would like to wear shoes, please ask about getting martial arts shoes which may be ordered through the club. If you wear any dangling jewlry or heavy rings, please remove these items before class.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-span-11 md:col-span-8 md:col-end">
    <%= render "layouts/contact" %>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold block mb-2.5 border-b border-gray-400">Schedule</h3>
    <p>
      Wednesday 8:30 pm to 9:30 pm<br/>
      Saturday 2 pm to 3 pm
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold block mb-2.5 border-b border-gray-400">Club Dues</h3>
    <p>
      $75 per month 
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold block mb-2.5 border-b border-gray-400">Location</h3>
    <p>
      <b>549 Zor Shrine Place, Madison WI</b>
    </p>
    <div class="relative aspect-square">
      <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d23322.35344961133!2d-89.51281000000002!3d43.05628!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8807afaa9ec5bb2b%3A0xbe608ae0627f72ee!2sOkinawan%20Karate%20Club%20of%20Madison!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1770072817082!5m2!1sen!2sus"
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full border-0"
      allowfullscreen=""
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
      </iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
  <br/>
  <%= render "layouts/footer" %>
</div>
